  "$comment": "Presentation metadata for each API operation. Behaviour (credits, async, input format) lives in openapi.json and is NEVER duplicated here \u2014 build.mjs merges the two and fails loudly if the two files disagree about which operations exist. Add an operation to openapi.json and the build will tell you to describe it here. Output shapes are derived from api-documentation.html and app.html's own result renderers, not from a live call \u2014 refresh sample values against a real response before publishing an app to a marketplace.",
